  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.2.0 - Architecture Refactor\n            - Refactored to Vertical Slice Architecture (VSA)\n            - Each feature is self-contained (handler, endpoints, models)\n            - Removed redundant service abstraction layers\n            - Fixed multipart/form-data handling in upload endpoint\n            - Fixed ambiguous IResult references\n            - Handlers directly inject IFileStorage\n            - Simplified naming: UploadHandler, DownloadHandler, etc.\n            - Improved maintainability and extensibility\n            \n            Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release\n            - Pre-built minimal API endpoints for file operations\n            - IFormFile upload support via endpoints\n            - UseStashPup middleware for file serving\n            - MapStashPupEndpoints for automatic API generation\n            - Dependency injection extensions (AddStashPup)\n            - Configuration builder pattern\n            - Supports all storage providers",
